  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="- Overview&#xA;Output Excel file based on DataTable of SAP Table Element Info, of which format can be processed by SRC_TABLEDATA_OUTPUT.&#xA;&#xA;- input&#xA;in_TableName as name of target Table &lt;String&gt;&#xA;in_OutPath as file path of output file &lt;String&gt;&#xA;in_OutFileName as name of output file &lt;String&gt;&#xA;in_OutColumnData as name of output DataTable &lt;DataTable&gt;" DisplayName="OutputElementToExcel" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_4">
